  "checks": [
    "Native managed descriptors and per-slot updates retain the Surface on the matching Proxy. Ownership tracing observes both icons, and a Surface from a different Proxy is rejected.",
    "Resize retains the prefix, retires truncated icons, and preserves state and references on OOM. Content updates preserve icons and animation metadata. Nullable icon replacement preserves slot contents.",
    "Clear-all commits every slot before release. A finalizer observes the cleared second slot and resizes the same grid safely. Failed retirement allocation preserves existing icon owners.",
    "The native fixture destroys 100,000 slots with owned media using iterative retirement. The xlang getter retains a returned Surface independently of the grid and Context.",
    "The JIT, dynamic and static fixtures exercise shared ownership and close the caller handle before rendering. The window example verifies both purple icon regions in JIT and static render captures."
  ],
  "costs": [
    "A set admits the matching surface, publishes the pointer under the existing ownership gate and releases the previous owner. The render path uses the existing Surface pointer.",
    "Resize moves the surviving references in the existing slot array copy. Clear-all allocates a temporary array of one pointer per installed icon to publish the bulk mutation before running finalizers. Destruction reuses the detached array.",
    "The paired profile alternates two already allocated Surface handles for 100 replacements in both implementations. It measures XRT heap operations and excludes Surface construction, finalization and elapsed time."
  ],
  "pending": [
    "InventoryGrid controlled scrolling and access to its embedded scroll model.",
    "Whole-goal XGE, XUI and Document audit and matched release/IDE delivery."
  ],
